### 2 cli render plan.x.md --format text
$ xmd render plan.x.md --format text --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T14:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
# Plan
## Launch :launch ███░░░░░ 2/5 complete · 2 in progress · 1h estimated left
- [x] Draft
- [-] Record the demo @estimate(1h)
- [ ] Ship :ship ████░░░░ 1/2 subtasks
  - [x] Tag
  - [ ] Publish
* [-] Sweep
+ [-]Glued

